        {
          "label": "Post 4-1",
          "text": "The AAP says counting screen hours is no longer enough. New research covers 20 years of studies. What matters is the type and context of use — not just the clock. Worth reading as kids head back to school. #COSParenting #ColoradoSprings #COSKids #PikesPeakParenting",
