          ],
          "char_count": 265
        },
        {
          "label": "Post 4-2",
          "text": "\"Simply taking devices away or enforcing rigid rules can backfire for parents.\" — Dr. Tiffany Munzer, Univ. of Michigan Hospital. The AAP's new screen time framework is about co-viewing and context, not hour limits. #COSParenting #ColoradoSprings #COSKids #PikesPeakParenting",
